  lesson-19 v1 lesson [holds] {"says":"A Jira description has one reader and one writer: readDescription and holdAsAsked in lib/providers/jira/as-asked-region.js, the only code that knows both the ADF region and the harbour.asAsked property; every provider-side getIssue passes AS_ASKED_READ. A new description read that calls adfToMarkdown directly serves converted words and silently breaks the seal; tests/unit/jira-as-asked-region.test.js fails on it (LIN-4450).","paths":["lib/providers/jira/as-asked-region.js","lib/providers/jira/index.js"],"checked-at":"f9fa4a80c"}
