  lesson-21 v1 lesson [holds] {"says":"The region reader accepts an end line whatever its marks, looser than splitAsAsked. It is safe only because descriptionRoundTrip runs the same reader the reads do, so a block the reader would misplace is refused at filing. Keep the seal check and the reads on one reader (LIN-4450).","paths":["lib/providers/jira/as-asked-region.js","lib/providers/jira/index.js"],"checked-at":"f9fa4a80c"}
